     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageReleases</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageReleases\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ManageReleases\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"REL-01\"> </a></b>Determine version number</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can review changes since last release, determine if changes are breaking, and update version number following semantic versioning.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"REL-02\"> </a></b>Update IG status for release</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can update IG and all conformance artifacts: status to active, version without label, releaseLabel to release, and date to current date.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"REL-03\"> </a></b>Create publication-request.json</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create a correct publication-request.json with matching package-id, version, path, ci-build, and first/subsequent flags.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"REL-04\"> </a></b>Create release tag</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create a GitHub release and tag in the form vX.Y.Z to trigger the automated publication workflow.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"REL-05\"> </a></b>Verify publication</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can verify the publication workflow succeeded and the IG is available at the sitepreview URL.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"REL-06\"> </a></b>Reset to draft</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can reset the main branch to draft status with updated version number after publication.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"REL-07\"> </a></b>Maintain change log</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can maintain a changes page with release summary, known issues, and categorized changes (non-compatible, compatible substantive, non-substantive).</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageReleases</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageReleases\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ManageReleases\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-REL-01\"> </a></b>Determine version number</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can review changes since last release, determine if changes are breaking, and update version number following semantic versioning.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-REL-02\"> </a></b>Update IG status for release</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can update IG and all conformance artifacts: status to active, version without label, releaseLabel to release, and date to current date.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-REL-03\"> </a></b>Create publication-request.json</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create a correct publication-request.json with matching package-id, version, path, ci-build, and first/subsequent flags.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-R